/-!
# Isotropic ↔ standard Schwarzschild: the two radial branches as coordinate relations (ATLAS-II)

* `relation_out (hM : 0 ≤ M)`: `CoordRelation (gIso M) (gStd M) (domIsoOut M) (domStdExt M) (toStd M) (fromStdOut M) (jacIso M)`,
